cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository or its results, please cite the master's thesis it is part of (preferred citation below)."
title: "5LTEP-L3 · Model benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Monthly, reproducible benchmark of small open LLMs for the LLM-as-a-Judge of the
  5L-TEP Layer 3 toolkit: a gold set whose answers are known by construction, the
  production prompt, three seeds, and a paired bootstrap rule for switching models,
  on free GitHub-hosted CPU runners (Ollama, llama.cpp, PrismML fork for Bonsai
  models). Part of the master's thesis cited below.
